flowchart TD
    Start([User Opens App]) --> Login[Login Page]
    Login --> RoleCheck{Role?}

    %% ASSISTANT PATH
    RoleCheck -->|Assistant| AssistPortal[Assistant Portal]
    AssistPortal --> ViewTable[View Active Cycle Record Table]
    AssistPortal --> AddEntry[Open: Add Patient Record Form]

    AddEntry --> FillForm[Enter Name, Category GP/Case,\nDiagnosis, Total Cost, Amount Paid Today]
    FillForm --> SaveEntry[Save Entry]
    SaveEntry --> ViewTable

    ViewTable --> CycleOpen{Cycle Locked?}
    CycleOpen -->|No, Open| EditEntry[Edit Existing Record]
    EditEntry --> SaveEntry
    CycleOpen -->|Yes, Locked| ReadOnly[Read-Only View\nNo Edits Allowed]

    %% ADMIN PATH
    RoleCheck -->|Admin| AdminPortal[Admin Portal]
    AdminPortal --> Dashboard[Live Financial Dashboard]
    AdminPortal --> LabRecon[Case & Lab Fee Reconciliation]
    AdminPortal --> Overhead[Monthly Overhead & Expenses Input]
    AdminPortal --> Closeout[Month-End Closeout]

    LabRecon --> AssignLab[Assign Lab Fee to Case]
    AssignLab --> AutoAgg[Lab Fees Auto-Aggregate]
    AutoAgg --> Dashboard

    Overhead --> EnterOverhead[Enter Salary, Bonus,\nRent, Utilities]
    EnterOverhead --> Dashboard

    Dashboard --> ViewKPIs[View Revenue, Commission,\nNet Profit/Loss]

    Closeout --> ConfirmStep1[Confirmation Step 1]
    ConfirmStep1 --> ConfirmStep2[Confirmation Step 2]
    ConfirmStep2 --> Partition{Partition Records}
    Partition -->|Balance = 0| HardDelete[Hard Delete\nSettled Records]
    Partition -->|Balance > 0| Carryover[Carry Forward\nto New Cycle]
    HardDelete --> NewCycle[New Monthly Cycle Opens]
    Carryover --> NewCycle
    NewCycle --> AssistPortal
